	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0401_waiter_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたくしの　ひそやかな　たのしみは
ポケウッドの　しんさく　えいが　です</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T10:30:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-07T03:04:57" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わたくしの　ひそやかな　楽しみは
ポケウッドの　新作映画です</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T10:30:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-07T03:05:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T05:53:05" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WAITER</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-07T03:04:35" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
